7L16.996 14.8432L23.7872 10.0456C23.9206 9.95133 24 9.7981 24 9.63469Z"></path></defs><use clip-path="url(#clip_RatingStar_undefined-1small)" href="#path_RatingStar_undefined-1small" class="RatingStar__backgroundFill"></use><path class="RatingStar__fill"></path></svg></span></span></div><span class="Text Text__body3"><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/5809277690">September 5, 2023</a></span></section><section class="ReviewText"><section class="ReviewText__content" dir="auto"><div class="TruncatedContent" tabindex="-1"><div class="TruncatedContent__text TruncatedContent__text--large" tabindex="-1" data-testid="contentContainer"><span class="Formatted">Oh god, everyone’s going to hate me…but….I can’t keep it in….THIS WAS SO MEH. <br /><br />There, I said it. I’m so fucking bummed. I’ve been waiting for this story since we got a 5 second blip of Everly &amp; Callum in Her Soul to Take. I was so excited to read the conclusion of this trilogy, and while I’m not disappointed in how it all finally ended, I was just so bored!! <br /><br />This is some serious insta-lust. There wasn’t much tension from a relationship/romance standpoint. Everly was confusing - is she confident? Is she scared, submissive &amp; naive? Who knows!! Cuz it changes each chapter, and it got old. Basically I skimmed everything from 50% on, just so I could get to the ending. And I really didn’t want to skim, but the relationship formed so quickly I was just left wondering…ok, now what? 😭😭😭😭<br /><br />And Callum…the impression I got of him from Leon’s POV in book 1 was that he was this badass, all-powerful, controlling demon. I was expecting some seeeerious alpha vibes and then we got…. "hey babe, here’s a strap-on, bend me over. I will do anything for my Mistress.” WHERE DID THAT COME FROM??<br /><br />WAIT I just remembered...the declaration of love/battle preparation piercing scene!! L O LLLLLL. Nothing screams romance like piercing your man's 🍆 and getting your 😺 pierced in return. I fucking died laughing/cringing.</span></div><div class=""></div></div></section></section><section class="ReviewCard__tags"><ul class="CollapsableList"><span tabindex="-1"><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/144706307?shelf=annoying-fl" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium"><span class="Button__labelItem">annoying-fl</span></a><span tabindex="-1"> </span><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/144706307?shelf=just-meh" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium"><span class="Button__labelItem">just-meh</span></a><span tabindex="-1"> </span><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/144706307?shelf=paranormal" class="Button Button--tag Button--medium"><span class="Button__labelItem">paranormal</span></a></span><span tabindex="-1"></span></ul></section><footer class="SocialFooter"><div data-testid="stats" class="SocialFooter__statsContainer"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium Button--subdued"><span class="Button__labelItem">59 likes</span></button></div><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium Button--subdued"><span class="Button__labelItem">16 comments</span></button></div></div><div data-testid="actions"><div class="SocialFooter__action"><div class="Button__container"><button type="button" class="Button Button--inline Button--medium" aria-label="Review unliked. Press to like review"><span class="Button__labelItem"><i class="Icon LikeIcon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M14.4813282,6.41129383 L14.586127,6.97676447 C14.5964421,7.03541935 14.6071117,7.09675198 14.6181364,7.1607667 L14.8551301,8.60363442 L17.440983,8.60363442 C18.1623576,8.60363442 18.8218187,9.01120377 19.1444272,9.65642083 L19.1708204,9.70920723 C19.4523479,10.2722622 19.4523479,10.9350066 19.1708204,11.4980616 L19.118034,11.6036344 L19.1708204,11.7092072 C19.4523479,12.2722622 19.4523479,12.9350066 19.1708204,13.4980616 L19.118034,13.6036344 L19.1708204,13.70