7 23.3476 5.16853 23.1876L12 18.3758L18.8317 23.183C18.9625 23.2751 19.1293 23.2994 19.281 23.2486C19.5445 23.1604 19.6865 22.8752 19.5983 22.6117L16.996 14.8432L23.7872 10.0456C23.9206 9.95133 24 9.7981 24 9.63469Z"></path></svg></span></span></div><span class="Text Text__body3"><a href="https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/5793332504">September 2, 2023</a></span></section><section class="ReviewText"><section class="ReviewText__content" dir="auto"><div class="TruncatedContent" tabindex="-1"><div class="TruncatedContent__text TruncatedContent__text--large" tabindex="-1" data-testid="contentContainer"><span class="Formatted">I’m not okay. I knew the series was ending. Honestly, I wasn’t ready to see the series end and was worth the wait. My favorite book in the series. <br />I’m <br />Soul Of A Witch is everything I expected and more. I love it when an author writes outside the box without giving out any spoilers. I love the power dynamic of Everly and Callum; It’s a unique take on a book I wish to see more of. Callum, my dirty. My favorite kind, You know, the kind you can't and some want to wash off. They both push each other boundaries <br /><br />We learned the backstory of Everly’s life, how her family treated Everly, and how she became a powerful witch with Callum by her side. <br /><br />Sorry, Leon and Zane, but Callum is the ultimate demon. I love how he rebelled and did what he thought was right. Even when he is feral, he has a softer side for Everly. Everly and Callum are beyond soulmates and their bond. They’re incredibly intense together. <br /><br />As much as I am obsessed with Callum, I can now add Everly to my list of book girlfriends. Her character growth is phenomenal. From the scared, timid witch she was to a Mistress-powerful Witch. <br /><br />All good things must come to an end, but what a fantastic ride it was.</span></div><div class=""></div></div></section></section><section class="ReviewCard__tags"><ul class="CollapsableList"><span tabindex