The Pretty Reckless\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eEverly was always told by her father that she cannot let her power out.\u003cbr /\u003eShe will not ruin everything for him.\u003cbr /\u003eBut when she sees something that changes everything, she will no longer be \"Daddy's little girl\"\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003ci\u003e\"I'm done being careful, I'm not fucking content being silent and sweet and permissive.\"\u003c/i\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003ci\u003e\"I was told not to play with dangerous things, but my mother is dead and my father is wicked. So I think I'll play how I please.\"\u003c/i\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eAnd luckily for her, Callum has been searching for her for years. And now that he found her. He will be damned if he lets he do this alone or if he lets her go.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003ci\u003e\"She needed to be assured of my utmost and unflagging devotion to the protection of this place and everything inside it. Including her. Especially her.\"\u003c/i\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003ci\u003e\"I'd spent centuries waiting for a glimpse of her. If I stared into her eyes much longer, I'd lose myself.\"\u003c/i\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThank you Harley Laroux for the arc! I received an e-arc in exchange for an honest review 🧡🖤🧡\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eOMG OMG OMG OMG\u003cbr /\u003eTHIS BOOK WAS EVERYTHING!!!!\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003ci\u003e\"The power in you is by far greater than any witch I've ever known.\"\u003c/i\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI was hooked on this series from the first book and I was hooked every book since but this book just took it to a whole new level!!\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003ci\u003e\"No matter how much it frightened me, I was going to fight.\"\u003c/i\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eEverly has become one of my top FMCs. \u003cbr /\u003eFighting her past, realizing her dad is legit evil, and doing everything in her power to kill the evil that remains.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003ci\u003e\"But the truth was different. And I had no idea why I could see it, why my mind was able to break through the hallucinations caused by the God's control… But I could. And I knew it.\"\u003c/i\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eAnd by her side you have Callum. Our hot arch demon who has been waiting for her for 2000 years.\u003cbr /\u003eAnd god, was he worth the wait let me tell you.\u003cbr /\u003eThat snippet of him we got in \"Her Soul for Revenge\" did not do him justice!!!\u003cbr /\u003eThis man is everything!! From the moment he opened his mouth I was hooked!\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003ci\u003e\"Oh, how easy it would be to catch her. But easy wasn't satisfying. A game ended too quickly was no game at all.\"\u003c/i\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003ci\u003e\"Who fucking hurt you? Give me their name.\"\u003c/i\u003e - Yes, yes. The who hurt you trope is strong with this one folks and it is everything!!\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eAnd boy what a mouth this demon has 🥵🥵🥵\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003ci\u003e\"You're so beautiful. Perfect for me to ruin.\"\u003c/i\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003ci\u003e\"A little appetizer before the main course. I'm not taking these panties off until you've soaked them.\"\u003c/i\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eBut don't forget about Everly. Because this girl can get it!! When I tell you Evelyn can run me over, burn me, and stuff me like a turkey, I am not joking!!\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003ci\u003e\"You get to be useful by being my seat while I get off. Don't touch. Don't struggle. Just watch.\"\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003ci\u003e\"Do as I told you, Callum. If you're good, maybe I'll fuck you like you asked.\"\u003c/i\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eIn summary, this book was amazing. Giving paranormal. Giving romance. Giving Spice. Proving once again, that whatever Harley Laroux writes I will read devour and but multiple copies\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cu\u003e\u003ci\u003e\"Every weapon needs a handler.\"\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e⚡\u003cu\u003e\n  \u003cb\u003eTropes\u003c/b\u003e\n\u003c/u\u003e⚡\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e🔥Paranormal Romance\u003cbr /\u003e🔥Bisexual MCs\u003cbr /\u003e🔥He falls first (and hard)\u003cbr /\u003e🔥Possessive MMC - Touch her and I'll do more than kill you\u003cbr /\u003e🔥Witch/Arch Demon\u003cbr /\u003e🔥Protective Bodyguard Vibes\u003cbr /\u003e🔥Horror but make it cozy (per the queen Harley Laroux's words)","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A2A7WAJ7JTZP07\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.xGzgQB5fkrWMYEan\"}}"},"likeCount":108,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":37},"User:133546057":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":133546057,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1783369618i/133546057._UX200_CR0,0,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":70304,"textReviewsCount":699,"name":"Larissa Cambusano","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/133546057-larissa-cambusano","contributor":null,"id":133546057},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A2JCCCMAIRNPTB":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A2JCCCMAIRNPTB"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A2JCCCMAIRNPTB\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.xGzgQB5fkrWMYEan\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A2JCCCMAIRNPTB","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A2JCCCMAIRNPTB"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.xGzgQB5fkrWMYEan","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.xGzgQB5fkrWMYEan"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read