/www.goodreads.com/review/list/144706307?shelf=read"},"taggings":[{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"annoying-fl","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/144706307?shelf=annoying-fl"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"just-meh","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/144706307?shelf=just-meh"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"paranormal","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/144706307?shelf=paranormal"}}],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/5809277690"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.09racGejCTgHnPr7ZnSSAw":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.09racGejCTgHnPr7ZnSSAw","creator":{"__ref":"User:144706307"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1783597565817,"createdAt":1693598779153,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1693927732290,"text":"Oh god, everyone’s going to hate me…but….I can’t keep it in….THIS WAS SO MEH. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThere, I said it. I’m so fucking bummed. I’ve been waiting for this story since we got a 5 second blip of Everly \u0026amp; Callum in Her Soul to Take. I was so excited to read the conclusion of this trilogy, and while I’m not disappointed in how it all finally ended, I was just so bored!! \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThis is some serious insta-lust. There wasn’t much tension from a relationship/romance standpoint. Everly was confusing - is she confident? Is she scared, submissive \u0026amp; naive? Who knows!! Cuz it changes each chapter, and it got old. Basically I skimmed everything from 50% on, just so I could get to the ending. And I really didn’t want to skim, but the relationship formed so quickly I was just left wondering…ok, now what? 😭😭😭😭\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eAnd Callum…the impression I got of him from Leon’s POV in book 1 was that he was this badass, all-powerful, controlling demon. I was expecting some seeeerious alpha vibes and then we got…. \"hey babe, here’s a strap-on, bend me over. I will do anything for my Mistress.” WHERE DID THAT COME FROM??\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eWAIT I just remembered...the declaration of love/battle preparation piercing scene!! L O LLLLLL. Nothing screams romance like piercing your man's 🍆 and getting your 😺 pierced in return. I fucking died laughing/cringing.","rating":3,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A3O4Y2W7QF02VD\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.xGzgQB5fkrWMYEan\"}}"},"likeCount":59,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":16},"User:126364621":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":126364621,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1712184000i/126364621._UX200_CR0,0,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":3831,"textReviewsCount":558,"name":"gloria .☆ﾟ.","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/126364621-gloria","contributor":null,"id":126364621},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/AN6NQSQWDEFUS":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/AN6NQSQWDEFUS"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/AN6NQSQWDEFUS\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.xGzgQB5fkrWMYEan\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/AN6NQSQWDEFUS","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/AN6NQSQWDEFUS"},"book":{"__ref":"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.xGzgQB5fkrWMYEan","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.xGzgQB5fkrWMYEan"},"shelf":{"__typename":"Shelf","name":"read","displayName":"Read","editable":false,"default":true,"actionType":"add_to_read","sortOrder":2,"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/126364621?shelf=read"},"taggings":[{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"arcs-or-review-copy","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/126364621?shelf=arcs-or-review-copy"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"online-tbr","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/126364621?shelf=online-tbr"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"romance-bdsm","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/126364621?shelf=romance-bdsm"}},{"__typename":"Tagging","tag":{"__typename":"Tag","name":"romance-paranormal","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/list/126364621?shelf=romance-paranormal"}}],"webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/review/show/5601551119"},"Review:kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.ovuxvXy4_QLK2vucASorog":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.ovuxvXy4_QLK2vucASorog","creator":{"__ref":"User:126364621"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1776273427604,"createdAt":1686102159091,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1704289878140,"text":"➥ 2.5 Stars *:･ﾟ✧\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cblockquote\u003e\u003cb\u003e“I bet you say that to everyone you’re with,” she said.\u003cbr /\u003eClutching her hips, I planted a kiss beside her navel.\u003cbr /\u003e“I’ve been alive too long to speak idly,” I said. “I’ve uttered those words to no one else.”\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e━━━━━━━━━━━ ♡ ━━━━━━━━━━━\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eHonestly, I'd be surprised if I don't get kicked off Harley's ARC team 😭. For one, because I've been (outrageously) late with my mediocre-ass whiney reviews. But to that I say... maybe it's because your book (that I wanted so badly to love and hype up!) was boring!\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eNow, it's so full of sweethearts on this site — people who motivate me to continue writing reviews — so here I am putting one out! Granted, I wish it could be a passionate, glowing review where I'd practically place your next read in your lap because of how I sold it, but sadly, that is \u003cb\u003e\n  \u003cu\u003enot\u003c/u\u003e\n\u003c/b\u003e the energy I can bring to the table today. There is a little sass though, so hopefully it'll be entertaining. Or! Sometimes the things I dislike in books are things that others seek so maybe my review won't be completely futile.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eLet's start with the not-so-bad. Harley Laroux's writing is, in my opinion, pretty fuckin commendable. I just think she describes what needs to be described, creates atmosphere and writes pretty natural and swoony dialogue. It's why I grew to love her work in the first place, because \u003ci\u003efrankly\u003c/i\u003e dark romance is \u003cb\u003e\n  \u003cu\u003enot\u003c/u\u003e\n\u003c/b\u003e the genre to go to in hopes of good writing, in my (decent) experience. No shade to other dark romance authors but Harley is doing something right that many of you have just failed to (*cough* H.D. Carlton and Giana Darling etc.).\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eAnother one of her strengths is that she \u003cu\u003eadds to the genre\u003c/u\u003e. Sure, she'll play with some tropes but to be, she stands out for a number of reasons.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e1) Her MMCs are pretty fuckin slutty and yet...so respectful. I know I know, we're not supposed to be in awe about these things nowadays but listen. She somehow nails the middle ground where there are fun, unique dynamics at play, yet with full consent, safety and generally just lovingness. These men really just love their girls and you can tell. Harley always confidently ticks that box for me.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e2) This one is gonna have a little shade in it but... I've grown to love Harley's fmcs, because in the previous sequel, we met the absolute gem of a woman: Juniper. This woman was hot, relatable and just oh-so-human. I want to see some sass, some grit in the FMCs of dark romance. It makes it so much more interesting when they're just as playful and teasing. And who doesn't love a power couple? But sadly, that was \u003cb\u003e\n  \u003cu\u003enot\u003c/u\u003e\n\u003c/b\u003e the case for this book.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eListen, maybe it's bc of how utterly homo I am, but I was \u003cb\u003e\n  \u003cu\u003eREADY\u003c/u\u003e\n\u003c/b\u003e to meet THE \u003cb\u003eEverly (h)\u003c/b\u003e. The setup of this book was TOO GOOD man. We were promised a sexually dominant woman and I was \u003cb\u003ehere for it\u003c/b\u003e. But \u003cb\u003e\"it\" didn't get the memo\u003c/b\u003e.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eEverly was meant to be this sickeningly, powerful witch who, yes, had her support pup (\u003cb\u003eCallumn (H)\u003c/b\u003e) at her feet... but what did I get?\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI get one of the meekest, most clueless and stuttery fmcs to date!! 😭😭😭\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cb\u003eBUT GET THIS\u003c/b\u003e she STILL tries to be dominant in bed 🤣🤣🤣. Listen, I'm not gonna yuck anyone's yum or however that goes, (bc ofc people can be dominant in bed and not irl and vice verse), but as a READER there was a complete tonal shift that just \u003cb\u003edid not work\u003c/b\u003e in favour of the character Harley was trying to create.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eMoreover, it was blatantly obvious that Callumn was just \u003ci\u003eletting her\u003c/i\u003e try out sexual dominance, and though he seemed to enjoy his submissive role too, it took almost all the agency and like...zest from Everly's dominance in the first place. Like he literally had to guide her through her own domination of him I'm SORRY?!? Like...I get how it's a ...healthy... way for her to explore her sexuality but goddamn what was I even reading.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eIt was never giving power couple, I was never swooning or giggling or twirling my hair for either character... it was just a mess.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eWhat I'd argue is best is when a character's personality matches their actions. Everly just had no bite in her man, it was \u003cb\u003e\n  \u003cu\u003eboring!!!\u003c/u\u003e\n\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eTo elaborate (☝ lol), there was also a complete lack of the general push and pull dynamic that Harley always nails like what?!? I mean, I'd rather they didn't read my review because I would be heartbroken to have a reader so disappointed in my latest work that I pride myself in but gosh. I gotta get it out, sorry bae.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThere was no tension, no will-they-won't-they, it was all just \u003cb\u003e\n  \u003ci\u003e\"we're friends yippee now let's fuck but this time I peg you and you stick to your puppy eyes meanwhile i'm literally Bambi so what now\"\u003c/i\u003e\n\u003c/b\u003e. Because it just didn't make sense I'm SORRY.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eBecause of that, it didn't really feel like there was much romantic development at all? It is so drilled into the reader that Callumn perceives Everly as being so naive and yet supposedly also like his divine powerful woman but...who's really buying it? Hand me a coupon because I CAN'T.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eNot to mention that I knew the plot would be repetitive but damn it just really lost its spark by the 3rd time witnessing the same plot from a different perspective.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eHolistically, I regret to report that this book failed on many fronts. I mean I just \u003ci\u003estill\u003c/i\u003e cannot believe we were robbed of a powerful female witch, exuding elegance and commanding respect, that toyed with Callumn — THAT'S what I had signed up for, personally.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eBy the end, it didn't feel like a love story and that's what Harley's other books have achieved (at least for me) in the past (the first two in this series).\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eBut unfortunately, I don't know what's in the air, or Harley's air for that matter, but her recent releases have left me somewhat stumped and entirely disappointed (the Losers duet etc). I keep feeling inclined to the \"but the next one's premise is so good, it'll be GREAT and I'll be back on the Harley Hype Train\" but that what I though about this one...\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eAnd yet still! I \u003cb\u003eknow\u003c/b\u003e that Harley has a 🚨🚨🚨 SAPPHIC RELEASE 🚨🚨🚨 planned, and I'm so ready for her to NAIL a tryst-six-venom-esque toxic lesbian romance but I'm hesitant to even get too excited for it.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eStill, I do look forward to seeing her take on it, as I truly do believe she has the potential to publish a DELICIOUS sapphic romance, however, this one left such a bad taste in my mouth (dnfed at 88%) that I'm literally setting it as \"read\" on December 31st, 2023 because I just \u003ci\u003edon't\u003c/i\u003e want to start the new year like this.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eGosh, I hate to call a woman pathetic but Everly's meek and pouty character was not it for me, and Callumn wasn't anything special either.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI've decided to still place one of the better quotes as the featured one for my review because like I said, it's not all bad, but it's just nothing in comparison to what I've seen Harley be capable of.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eOnto a new year and many more reviews! \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003ci\u003eThank you Harley Laroux for an ARC of this book in exchange for an honest review!\u003c/i\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cblockquote\u003e━━━━━━━━━━━ ♡ ━━━━━━━━━━━\u003c/blockquote\u003e","rating":2,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/AN6NQSQWDEFUS\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.xGzgQB5fkrWMYEan\"}}"},"likeCount":55,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":6},"User:81118373":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":81118373,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1747479753i/81118373._UY200_CR19,0,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":346,"textReviewsCount":463,"name":"Milo (if lost, return to h