more. I love it when an author writes outside the box without giving out any spoilers. I love the power dynamic of Everly and Callum; It’s a unique take on a book I wish to see more of. Callum, my dirty. My favorite kind, You know, the kind you can't and some want to wash off. They both push each other boundaries \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eWe learned the backstory of Everly’s life, how her family treated Everly, and how she became a powerful witch with Callum by her side. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eSorry, Leon and Zane, but Callum is the ultimate demon. I love how he rebelled and did what he thought was right. Even when he is feral, he has a softer side for Everly. Everly and Callum are beyond soulmates and their bond. They’re incredibly intense together. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eAs much as I am obsessed with Callum, I can now add Everly to my list of book girlfriends. Her character growth is phenomenal. From the scared, timid witch she was to a Mistress-powerful Witch. \u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eAll good things must come to an end, but what a fantastic ride it was.","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A1OD0Q29PO9XGD\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.xGzgQB5fkrWMYEan\"}}"},"likeCount":36,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":0},"User:143394693":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":143394693,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1691947847i/143394693._UX200_CR0,0,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":1183,"textReviewsCount":390,"name":"winotka.books","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/143394693-winotka-books","contributor":null,"id":143394693},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A2KY7SJ92VJMPD":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A2KY7SJ92VJMPD"},"Book:kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.qhoMcxgLwe1bZvNm":{"__typename":"Book","id":"kca://book/amzn1.gr.boo