ds.v1.lF4Oup5dh1yRIMPL2KrV5A":{"__typename":"Review","id":"kca://review:goodreads/amzn1.gr.review:goodreads.v1.lF4Oup5dh1yRIMPL2KrV5A","creator":{"__ref":"User:14949982"},"recommendFor":null,"updatedAt":1733284065636,"createdAt":1692995946421,"spoilerStatus":false,"lastRevisionAt":1693165496531,"text":"So glad to get back to this world and wrap up this story. I was swooning, gasping, covering my eyes, and thrilled the whole time.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eEverly is a character I have been curious about since the beginning. I knew more was going on with her, even when it was hard to feel for her at the beginning. She is stuck in a cult she wants nothing to do with but sees no escape. She has been brainwashed and mistreated and told she is next to useless.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThen... something happens that pushes her over the edge and frees her from the clutches of her demented father. She discovers a magical house with a demon inside who tells her she can kill the creature she has been forced to worship.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eCallum is that demon and he has been patiently waiting for Everly to find him. He is there to help her take control of her powers and fight the evil looking to consume everything. But he's not just here for that.. he's also here for HER. He's been waiting so long and now that he has her... he'd let the world burn to keep her.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI could not put this book down. I was obsessed with Everly and Callum right from the start. She has been through so much and it was hard to read about how she was treated and see the hopelessness of her situation. Watching her come into her magic and seeing her lose the chains that held her down was thrilling.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eThat magic house in the woods was EVERYTHING! I loved the creatures and ghosts we met, the magic I saw Everly learn, and of course... the experimenting Callum coaxes her into... (see the steamy content warnings for a tease at that).\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI was a bit nervous after how long we waited for this conclusion to the trilogy but Harley Laroux delivered 100% for me. And I actually want to start from the beginning again to see how it all fits together. It came together so beautifully and I loved the cameos of all our previous faves.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eI highly recommend this whole trilogy and I think it only got stronger with each entry. I can't wait to see what the author writes next.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e5 stars\u003cbr /\u003e5 on the spice scale\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eTW: Abusive parent, death of a parent, torture, cult activity, discussion of pregnancy loss, body horror, and other horror elements, consensual drug use during sex\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cbr /\u003eSexy CW: bondage, impact play, public play, blood play, knife play, lots of fluids, piercing play, monster cock, pegging and more","rating":5,"preReleaseBookSource":null,"shelving":{"__ref":"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A1TDNYEI6R4C0D\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.xGzgQB5fkrWMYEan\"}}"},"likeCount":27,"viewerHasLiked":null,"commentCount":1},"User:3587456":{"__typename":"User","legacyId":3587456,"imageUrlSquare":"https://i.gr-assets.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/users/1617150820i/3587456._UX200_CR0,0,200,200_.jpg","isAuthor":false,"viewerRelationshipStatus":null,"followersCount":1107,"textReviewsCount":692,"name":"Valkyrie ✨","webUrl":"https://www.goodreads.com/user/show/3587456-valkyrie","contributor":null,"id":3587456},"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A1TFSY1Y7L0DSJ":{"__typename":"User","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A1TFSY1Y7L0DSJ"},"Shelving:{\"creator\":{\"id\":\"kca://profile:goodreads/A1TFSY1Y7L0DSJ\"},\"book\":{\"id\":\"kca://book/amzn1.gr.book.v3.xGzgQB5fkrWMYEan\"}}":{"__typename":"Shelving","creator":{"__ref":"User:kca://profile:goodreads/A1TFSY1Y7L0DSJ","id":"kca://profile:goodreads/A1TFSY1Y7L0DSJ"},"book":